WEBVTT

00:08:28.625 --> 00:08:30.851
until the internally displaced persons

00:08:30.875 --> 00:08:32.957
started to go back
to their place of origin.

00:08:33.875 --> 00:08:37.375
I established four mother-child
health care units,

00:08:38.582 --> 00:08:42.558
especially to take care of
over 10,000 women and children

00:08:42.582 --> 00:08:44.042
nearby the camps.

00:08:45.250 --> 00:08:50.226
But you know, during
all these visits,

00:08:50.250 --> 00:08:55.333
I observed that there was very little
attention towards women's needs.

00:08:56.583 --> 00:08:59.268
And I was looking for
what is the reason behind it.

00:08:59.292 --> 00:09:04.601
And I found it was because
of the underrepresentation of women